WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,010 --> 00:00:02,600
Sister Xie Ya

2
00:00:02,650 --> 00:00:03,730
That's what I saw first

3
00:00:03,730 --> 00:00:05,930
You've already eaten crabs. Give me the pepper.

4
00:00:05,930 --> 00:00:07,490
Blueberries should be enjoyed by everyone, right?

5
00:00:08,970 --> 00:00:10,690
Don't even steal it from us.

6
00:00:10,690 --> 00:00:11,690
Actually became a baby

7
00:00:11,690 --> 00:00:13,370
Haven't you seen the difference yet?

8
00:00:14,360 --> 00:00:15,640
Should we think about it?

9
00:00:15,640 --> 00:00:17,280
Why can she always find something to eat?

10
00:00:17,280 --> 00:00:19,080
Isn't it just luck? She can hit it once or twice

11
00:00:19,080 --> 00:00:20,360
I don't believe we can bump into each other again and again

12
00:00:20,360 --> 00:00:24,320
Then you'll be lucky tomorrow and show me once. It's not too demanding, let alone two pheasants and you can catch one.

13
00:00:24,320 --> 00:00:26,080
What do you mean? It doesn't mean anything.

14
00:00:26,080 --> 00:00:27,640
It's just her luck that she's very polite.

15
00:00:27,640 --> 00:00:28,960
Come to work on time every day

16
00:00:28,960 --> 00:00:30,200
Your luck may be lost

17
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:32,240
Stop trying to get lucky and start

18
00:00:32,240 --> 00:00:33,560
I saw the method Su Che used

19
00:00:33,560 --> 00:00:34,560
Learn what you can learn

20
00:00:34,560 --> 00:00:35,960
If you can't learn it, just admit that you can't.

21
00:00:37,510 --> 00:00:39,350
You guys cook slowly and I'll eat first.
